  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: PaladinSquad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Paladin Squad
  role: 2
  description: 'The United Kingdom of Aelfland''s armored knights: a Sergeant and
    four Troopers in powered armor, armed only with Broadswords. A sword strike does
    5 damage at penetration 1, but only within 2 m, so the Paladins must close in
    before they can fight. Armor Level 2 halves rifle fire on the way, but at 6 m
    a move (12 m sprinting) they need cover to get there. Once in close range they
    keep fighting where riflemen can''t. Heavy Support, so you can field more than
    one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8122d5773035e934fbbea1ccf0be2171, type: 2}
